# elf — authored from all eight walk facings in pix/elf.png (design §16).
# Tiny boots, a short diagonal tunic, bent one-voxel arms, long ears and the
# dark hair column keep the original compact silhouette; no invented bow.
# Layers run bottom-up; first row is back, last row is front.

